00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,820
居然说我娘炮
Call me a lady part.

368
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:02,760
老子要用行动去证明
We'll see about that.

369
00:16:06,030 --> 00:16:07,360
你能看见迷题吗
Can you reach the clue?

370
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,310
差不多了
Almost.

371
00:16:08,310 --> 00:16:09,670
快点  谢尔顿和佩妮
Hurry, Sheldon and Penny

372
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:11,950
在保龄球馆时就在我们后面
were right behind us in the bowling alley.

373
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:13,040
看到了
Got it!

374
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,340
太棒了  爬上来
Great, climb back up.

375
00:16:17,070 --> 00:16:19,860
爬啊
Come on!

376
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:24,050
佩妮说的话也不是完全没有道理
Yeah, Penny might be onto something.

377
00:16:26,070 --> 00:16:27,110
去天文馆
To the planetarium!

378
00:16:27,110 --> 00:16:27,890
出发
Let's go!

379
00:16:28,490 --> 00:16:29,610
去拉布雷亚沥青坑[洛杉矶考古遗址]
To the tar pits!

380
00:16:29,610 --> 00:16:30,270
出发
Let's go!

381
00:16:30,450 --> 00:16:32,270
下个月有尼尔·戴蒙德的演唱会
There's a Neil Diamond concert next month!

382
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:33,160
去吧[出发]
Let's go!

383
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:38,310
三个袋子  没人打开
Three bags, no one's opened 'em.

384
00:16:38,310 --> 00:16:39,880
我们是最先到的
We're the first ones here!

385
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,480
这袋是脏衣服  给你
It's dirty laundry. You're up.

386
00:16:43,260 --> 00:16:44,170
为什么是我
Why me?

387
00:16:44,170 --> 00:16:46,410
你为此做了一辈子的训练准备
Because you've been training for this your whole life.

388
00:16:46,410 --> 00:16:49,290
你生活在一堆脏衣服之中
You live in a pile of dirty laundry.

389
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:52,220
他们先到了
They're here first.

390
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:55,500
都怪你逼我为那个盲人减速让路
This is because you made me slow down for that blind guy.

391
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:57,600
线索肯定在袋子里
Okay, the clue must be in the bag.

392
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,270
线索肯定在袋子里
The clue must be in the bag.

393
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:00,960
只是一堆裤子
What's... it's just a bunch of pants.

394
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,690
只是一堆裤子
It's just a bunch of pants.

395
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:04,690
我很意外你居然抄袭我的答案
You know, I'm surprised you want to copy my answers

396
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:06,650
毕竟我蠢到根本不配和你一组
since I'm not even smart enough to be on your team.

397
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:09,010
你为什么想和我一组
Well, why would you want to be on someone's team

398
00:17:09,010 --> 00:17:10,340
你不是管我叫...
who you like to call a...

399
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:12,960
这词我都不敢当着谢尔顿的面说
I can't even say it in front of Sheldon.

400
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:14,820
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

401
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:16,900
你心知肚明
You know exactly what I'm talking about.

402
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:17,500
不  她不知道
No, she doesn't.

403
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:19,140
我瞎掰的
I just made that up.

404
00:17:20,210 --> 00:17:21,330
你为什么要这样做
Why would you do that?

405
00:17:21,330 --> 00:17:22,770
因为你想退出  就像一个大...
Because you were about to quit like a big--

406
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:24,230
谢尔顿  捂住耳朵
Sheldon, cover your ears.

407
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:27,510
我不是小孩子了
I'm not a child.

408
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:29,480
我知道"笨笨"这个词
I know the word "ninny."

409
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:30,880
你应该退出
Yeah, well, you should have quit

410
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,550
因为我会让你输得一败涂地
'cause I'm still gonna beat your ass.

411
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:35,390
有个像她一样的女汉子和我一组就好了
Wish I had a man like her on my team.

412
00:17:35,690 --> 00:17:37,140
我从头到脚
Hey, I-I am every bit

413
00:17:37,140 --> 00:17:38,620
都和佩妮一样有爷们气概  好吗
as much of a man as Penny.

414
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:40,650
开工吧
Now, let's do this!

415
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,870
慢着  不全是裤子  还有件T恤
Wait, it's not all pants, there's one shirt.

416
00:17:44,970 --> 00:17:46,340
这是我的T恤
Hey, that's my shirt.

417
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:47,540
这件也是
This one is, too.

418
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:48,600
不  那件不是我的
No, no, that's not mine.

419
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,800
上面有一大块污点
That has a big spot on it.

420
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:50,300
慢着
But wait.

421
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:51,470
这件也一样
So does this one.

422
00:17:51,470 --> 00:17:53,710
也许这个污点是线索
Maybe the spot's the clue.

423
00:17:58,450 --> 00:17:59,150
谢尔顿的专座[污点]
"Sheldon's spot."

424
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:00,910
金币在你专座那里
The coin is in your spot!

425
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:05,690
-真聪明  -那就快点啊
- Oh, that's clever. - Hurry!

426
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:06,640
我马上就来
Be there in a minute.

427
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,840
我得把脏T恤先泡一下
I just have to pre-soak these!

428
00:18:14,430 --> 00:18:17,320
拦住她  莱纳德  拦住她
Stop her, Leonard! Stop her!

429
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:25,820
那金币他娘的上哪去了
Well, where the hell's the coin?

430
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:27,910
难道答案不是谢尔顿的专座吗
Wasn't the answer Sheldon's spot?

431
00:18:27,910 --> 00:18:30,230
是的  莱纳德
Oh, yes, Leonard.

432
00:18:30,230 --> 00:18:32,060
答案完全正确
Yes, it was.

433
00:18:33,690 --> 00:18:35,110
那金币在哪里
Then where's the coin?

434
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:36,750
问得太好了
Yes, exactly.

435
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,860
金币在哪里呢
Where is the coin?

436
00:18:39,530 --> 00:18:42,260
你们为什么不看看自己的口袋呢
Why don't you look in your pockets?

437
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:48,430
我今天早些时候悄悄放进去的
I slipped them in there earlier today.

438
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,840
我不明白
I don't get it.

439
00:18:52,490 --> 00:18:53,690
你还不明白吗
Don't you see?

440
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:55,430
大家一起玩得很开心时
When we're all having fun together,

441
00:18:55,430 --> 00:18:57,530
每个人都是赢家
we're already winners.

442
00:18:57,530 --> 00:18:58,700
看
Oh, look.

443
00:18:58,700 --> 00:18:59,400
瞧
See?

444
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:02,170
就连我也是赢家
Even I'm a winner.

445
00:19:04,170 --> 00:19:06,290
你是不是玩儿我呢
Are you kidding me?

446
00:19:07,190 --> 00:19:09,970
这是我听过最傻逼的事
That is the stupidest thing I've ever heard.

447
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:14,920
你真是烂到爆了
You suck so hard.

448
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:16,710
我以为
Well, I thought...

449
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:18,610
拜托  我不希望任何人
Come on, I didn't want anyone

450
00:19:18,610 --> 00:19:20,660
在游戏结束时  因为输了而难过
to feel bad at the end of the game.

451
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,840
有些谜题真的很难
And some of those puzzles were really hard

452
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:25,410
我不知道谁会倒霉得和佩妮一组啊
and I didn't know who was gonna get Penny.

453
00:19:30,990 --> 00:19:33,040
滚
Run.

454
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,930
好吧  这话是我说得不好
Okay, okay, that-that came out wrong,

455
00:19:34,930 --> 00:19:36,040
但你们得承认
but you have to admit,

456
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:38,810
游戏过程你们都很开心啊
you all had a wonderful time.

457
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:42,660
快滚回印度躲着
Run to India.

458
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:46,950
人家只是想做件令人感动的事
I just wanted to do something beautiful!

459
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:51,080
你们看
Hey, look.

460
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,840
我赢了
I won.

